# Manioc Server — release recipe ship list (Repo Review 3 task 10, B9).
#
# A release build (build/build-iso.sh) fetches, verifies and packages
# EXACTLY the recipes named in this file — one recipe id per line,
# blank lines and #-comments ignored. Both the fetch step
# (build/fetch-recipe-archives.sh) and the factory-package loop in
# build/build-iso.sh honour this list, so what is fetched is what
# ships, and nothing else in recipes/ can enter a release image.
#
# marketplace is EXCLUDED from this list until owner decision 3 is
# met — i.e. until the marketplace recipe is rebuildable from a
# pinned public commit. Do not add it before then: a release build
# must be incapable of including it.
#
# A different set may be built ONLY as a clearly-marked non-release
# build (OH_RECIPES + OH_NONRELEASE_BUILD=1 — see the top-level
# README.md). The override never changes this file or the default.
